      "text_sha256": "009fa99839dc3257fda5357cffa6d70cbdb68e989ea31f6bac3dc83ff2b97d11"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0912-block-0041",
      "order": 41,
      "text": "Liquid amitriptyline is \navailable. It is acidic and \nmay interact with enteral \nfeeds.\n",
      "bbox": [
        325.7921142578125,
        280.1728820800781,
        407.8645935058594,
        318.87286376953125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "291ecf4b93e03211e4da9ab75d11403b9ad5fd4f6ac8ef5616647d9c6223b069"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0912-block-0042",
      "order": 42,
      "text": "Dosulepin capsules can be \nopened and mixed with \nwater before flushing well. \nThis is preferred to \ncrushing tablets.\n",
      "bbox": [
        325.7921142578125,
        322.99786376953125,
        413.587158203125,
        371.6953430175781
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ba4b1958ff93ffae33d1602be7eda18acdf06199a85205e7e4a76e5647c01ee4"
    },
    {
